    "description": "<p>You manifest a fuchsia-colored flame and place it on a wounded creature you can see within range.</p>\n<p>Target creature rolls 2 Hit Die, spending one. When they do, they recover twice the result.</p>\n<p>After casting the target creature gains resistance to Fire damage until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the number of Hit die rolled and spent by 1.</p>",
